{"t":"Doomforge","s":"doomforge-ca366","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Skin_of_Gralvalon_fa69a9.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Doomforge</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">14.10.4e0c16<br/>November 25, 2024<br/>Winter Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Doomforge</b> allows players to exchange one of the base <a href=\"#/wiki/Inferniarch%20Set\">Inferniarch Set</a> weapons for one of its upgraded versions. Players must visit <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Forgemaster\">The Forgemaster</a> after fighting <a href=\"#/wiki/Arbaziloth\">Arbaziloth</a> in its hard mode to be able to exchange one base weapon and the required <a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a> to get one of the upgraded versions:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Rending: 1x <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Skin%20of%20Gralvalon\"><img alt=\"Skin of Gralvalon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skin_of_Gralvalon_fa69a9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Skin%20of%20Gralvalon\">Skin of Gralvalon</a>, 1x <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demonic%20Finger\"><img alt=\"Demonic Finger\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\"